[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m### 2. Semantic bug: Incorrect [38;5;10mblake256_update[0m bit-length arguments (blake_hash.rs)[0m[0m
This was the core correctness bug. The C function [38;5;10mblake256_update(S, data, datalen)[0m takes [38;5;10mdatalen[0m in [1mbits[22m, not bytes. The C [38;5;10mgen_message_random[0m calls:[0m[0m
