[38;5;252m[1m### 3. Truncated output: Only SPX_N bytes written to R (blake_hash.rs)[0m[0m
The C [38;5;10mblakeX_final(&S, R)[0m writes the full 32-byte BLAKE256 digest to R. The Rust only copied [38;5;10mSPX_N[0m (16) bytes:[0m[0m
[1mrust
[0m[38;5;10mr[..SPX_N].copy_from_slice(&full_out[..SPX_N]);  // only 16 of 32 bytes
[0m[0m[0m
